+        // changed by an earlier body instruction. Also, narrow Thumb data
+        // instructions with an optional CPSR def suppress their flag update
+        // inside IT, but set flags outside IT even when MC carries NoRegister.
+        // Keep both shapes under the refusal guard until safely widened.
